  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Using the binomial expansion in the given expression we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>7</mn><mn>2022</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2022</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>50</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>1011</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>1011</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>1011</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mn>50</mn></mfenced><mn>1011</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>1011</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mn>50</mn></mfenced><mn>1010</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1011</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>1011</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mn>50</mn></mfenced><mn>0</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>1011</mn></msup></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>1011</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mn>10</mn></mfenced><mn>1011</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>1011</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mn>10</mn></mfenced><mn>1010</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1011</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>1011</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mn>10</mn></mfenced><mn>0</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>1011</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Using binomial expansion we get the remainder as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
